{"message":"Your identity is verified, and I opened the Silver Account successfully. It is open with a $0.00 balance; no funds have been moved yet.

I’m unable to submit the Silver Rewards Card application from this service because no supported card-opening action is available here. The card does require a credit check and has a published minimum credit score of 680, so it matches your preference, but approval would still be subject to the bank’s review.

Would you like me to transfer you to a human card specialist to complete that application? Also, please confirm whether you want me to move the full $8,000 from your Light Blue checking account into the new Silver Account now."}
